        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Venge un Pokémon de l’équipe mis K.O.\nSi un Pokémon de l’équipe a été mis\nK.O. au tour d’avant, l’effet augmente.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user gets revenge for a fainted\nally. If an ally fainted in the previous\nturn, this attack’s damage increases.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user gets revenge for a fainted\nally. If an ally fainted in the previous\nturn, this attack’s damage increases.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "たおれた　みかたの　かたきを　うつ。\nまえの　ターンに　たおされて\nいると　いりょくが　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "쓰러진 같은 편의 원수를 갚는다.\n앞 턴에서 같은 편이\n쓰러졌다면 위력이 올라간다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Venge un Pokémon de l’équipe mis K.O.\nSi un Pokémon de l’équipe a été mis K.O.\nau tour d’avant, l’effet augmente.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anwender rächt einen besiegten Mitstreiter.\nWurde in der vorherigen Runde ein Mitstreiter\nbesiegt, steigt die Kraft.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ataca con un tentáculo o brazo impregnado de\nveneno que puede llegar a envenenar al objetivo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Vendica un alleato messo KO. Se ciò è accaduto\nal turno precedente, il danno è maggiore.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user gets revenge for a fainted ally.\nIf an ally fainted in the previous turn,\nthis move becomes more powerful.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "倒れた　味方の　かたきを　討つ。\n前の　ターンに　味方が\n倒されていると　威力が　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ataca con un tentáculo o brazo impregnado de\nveneno que puede llegar a envenenar al objetivo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "とがった　つので　あいてを\nつきさして　こうげきする。\nこうげきは　かならず　あたる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "뾰족한 뿔로 상대를\n꿰찔러서 공격한다.\n공격은 반드시 맞는다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用尖尖的角刺進對手進行攻擊。\n攻擊必定會命中。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur transperce la cible avec sa corne effilée.\nTouche toujours l’ennemi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der Anwender durchbohrt das Ziel mit seinem\nspitzen Horn. Diese Attacke trifft immer.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ensarta al adversario con su afilada cornamenta.\nEste movimiento acierta siempre.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa colpisce il bersaglio con un corno\nappuntito. Questa mossa va sempre a segno.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user stabs the target with a sharp horn.\nThe attack never misses.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "とがった　つので　相手を\n突き刺して　攻撃する。\n攻撃は　必ず　当たる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
